    {
      "bbox": [
        184,
        1324,
        1894,
        1701
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "This action is taken in accordance with the recommendations of my Committee on Planning and Operations set up to deal with the threatened transit strike. This Committee is made up of the Commissioners of Police, Fire, Health, Hospitals, Welfare, Purchase, Traffic, Marine & Aviation, Water Supply, Gas and Electricity, the Corporation Counsel, a representative of the five Borough Presidents and the City Administrator. The Chairman of the Committee is Police Commissioner, Francis V. H. Adams. He has been authorized to mobilize the City's activities in this connection. You will receive future directives from him.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2784,
          "min": -1.634
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 115,
          "mean": -0.0042,
          "min": -0.3523
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 35355,
        "area_px": 613116,
        "density": 0.05766,
        "chars": 616,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 17.42
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        180,
        1747,
        1856,
        2010
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "While I am optimistic and believe that some way will be found to avoid the strike, each Department must be prepared to act in the event of an emergency. Accordingly, you are authorized and directed to take such steps as are required and to arrange leaves and vacations for all such staff as can be spared until further notice, in the event that the strike materializes on June 14th. The essential purpose is to eliminate unnecessary transportation.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2393,
          "min": -1.3091
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 87,
